## How to Use the App

### For guests (form page)
- Share the URL via WhatsApp, Instagram link in bio, etc.
- Works on all phones — no app download needed
- The live counter updates in real-time as requests come in

### For the DJ (dashboard)
- Scroll to the very bottom of the form page
- Click the small **"🎧 DJ Access"** link
- Enter your PIN (default: `2121`)
- Dashboard features:
  - **Top Songs** — bar chart of most requested songs with fuzzy duplicate grouping
  - **Genre Breakdown** — see what vibes the crowd wants
  - **All Submissions table** — every request in full
  - **Export CSV** — download everything as a spreadsheet
  - **QR Code** — generate a QR code to project or print for easy sharing

