## Firebase Security (optional but recommended)

After the party, lock down your database so nobody can write to it anymore.

In Firebase Console → Firestore → **Rules**, replace with:

```
rules_version = '2';
service cloud.firestore {
  match /databases/{database}/documents {
    match /song_requests/{doc} {
      allow read: if false;   // only you can read (via console)
      allow write: if false;  // no more submissions
    }
  }
}
```

During the event, the default "test mode" rules are fine.

